  "notable_quotes": [
    "All-atom MD with experimental loadings reproduced n-C8-n-C16 diffusion coefficients within a factor of 5 of experiment across 300-400 K.",
    "Activation energies agreed with experiment within 1.5 kJ mol-1 for shorter alkanes, and the chain-length trend was also reproduced.",
    "Earlier MD at 300 K overestimated diffusion by 2-3 orders of magnitude; the error was attributed to rigid frameworks and united-atom hydrocarbon models."
